  - key: INGAME_LEFT_BOTTOM_FREE_SPIN_COUNT_1
    value: "<b><size=36><color=#ffea00>{0}</color></size>\r\n<size=20>FREE GAMES PLAYED</size></b>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SPECIAL_SYMBOL_NAME_FORMAT
    value: <style=title><size=32>{0:Symbol;Upper}</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: '<size=24>Wild substitutes for

      ALL symbols.</size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<size=28>5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE_GAMES
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES
    value: "<size=24>- Free Games is triggered for each line win with 3 or more Bonus
      symbols.\r\n- Up to 450 Free Games can be triggered with Bonus symbols on all
      win lines.\r\n\r\n- Choose between 2 options for Free Games.\r\n- Option 1:
      Play the number of Free Games won. All wins will be doubled.\r\n- Option 2:
      Skip Free Games and spin a Wheel to win a mystery credit award.\r\n\r\n- Mystery
      credit award will be a random amount between the minimum and\r\nmaximum possible
      amount won in Free Games.\r\n- User can opt for the mystery credit award bonus
      anytime during Free Games.\r\n- The min and max amount will be adjusted according
      to Free Games left.\r\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>50 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: BUTTON_FREE_SPIN_START
    value: START
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=30>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOTS
    value: <style=coinColor><size=30>Party Bonus Jackpot Pays</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS
    value: "<size=20>-   Each                +1 Spin symbol awards an extra spin that
      is shared among all players.\n\n-   All                 become                Coin
      symbols after they've awarded extra spins.</size>"
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Beauty In Red
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_1
    value: "<size=20>All wins pay LEFT to RIGHT on adjacent reels, beginning with
      leftmost reel.\r\n\r\nAll wins are paid on lines played, which are added to
      line wins.\r\n\r\nHighest win paid on any played line.\r\n\r\nAll wins are multiplied
      by the number of coins bet per line.\r\n\r\nThe feature is triggered when the
      player has 5 consecutive wins.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_2
    value: <size=15>PLAYER IS RESPONSIBLE TO CONFIRM WAGER.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: <size=35>MOMENTUM RE-SPIN RULES</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: "<size=20>During the base game, whenever a spin contains a win on any line,\r\nthe
      player is paid for wins and all reels will re-spin until there is a losing\r\nspin
      or until there are 5 consecutive wins.\r\n\r\nDuring each re-spin, an extra
      Goddess symbol will substitute for a\r\nWILD symbol giving more wins! After
      the 5th consecutive win, the\r\nfeature will be triggered.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_WILD_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=35>

      5 <style=coinColor>{3:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      </size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_1
    value: <size=35>SUBSTITUTION PAYS</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_2
    value: '<size=23>

      WILDS substitute for all symbols.


      When one or more WILDS substitute in a win, highest win is paid.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_3
    value: <size=15>ALL PAYS SHOWN WITH A WAGER OF 1 COIN.</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_5_1
    value: <size=35>Bonus Free Spins</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_5_2
    value: '<size=20>When triggered the player will receive 14 free spins.


      Within the free spins, increasing multipliers will be applied to each

      re-spin. Goddess symbols turn to WILDs after each win as in the base

      game.


      If the player continues to win after the 5th consecutive win, then re-spins

      will continue with all Goddess symbols WILD until there is a losing spin.</size>'
  - key: BIG_WIN
    value: Big Win!
  - key: SUPER_BIG_WIN
    value: Super Big Win!
  - key: MEGA_WIN
    value: Mega Win!
  - key: SUPER_MEGA_WIN
    value: Super Mega Win!
  - key: EPIC_WIN
    value: Epic Win!
  - key: COMMA_NUMBER
    value: '{0:CommaNumber}'
  - key: SIMPLE_NUMBER
    value: '{0:SimpleNumber}'
  - key: USER_PROFILE_PATH
    value: '{0:00}/Profile Picture Small'
  - key: RANK_CREDIT_PATH
    value: '{0:00}/Text Coin'
  - key: RANK_NAME_PATH
    value: '{0:00}/Text Name'
  - key: RANK_PHOTO_PATH
    value: '{0:00}/Profile Picture Small/Image'
  - key: RANK_CREDIT_TEXT
    value: '{0:CommaNumber}'
  - key: RANK_NAME_TEXT
    value: '{0}'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_NAME_0
    value: <style=coinColor><size=30>WILD</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_WILD
    value: <style=coinColor><size=30>WILD</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PARTY_BONUS_TRIGGER
    value: <style=coinColor><size=30>Party Bonus Trigger</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_WILD_FEATURE
    value: "<size=20>-   Wild appears on reel 3 only.\n-   When Wild appears, a symbol
      from the reel set is selected randomly.\n-   All of the selected symbols on
      the reels are replaced with Wild before\n    pay is evaluated.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PARTY_BONUS_TRIGGER
    value: "<size=20>-   Sub-symbols are collected and used to increase the <b>Party
      Bonus Gauge</b>\n    and Party Points.\n-   The higher the bet level, the more
      the Party Bonus bet increases.\n-   All users in the room collect together towards
      the Bonus Gauge.\n-   Party Bonus is triggered when the Bonus Gauge is full.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PARTY_BONUS
    value: <style=coinColor><size=30>Party Bonus</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PARTY_BONUS
    value: "<size=20>-   When triggered, all players in the room enter the Party Bonus
      together.\n\n-   Party Bonus begins with 5 spins and is played on 15 independent
      reels.\n\n-   Only                                                                                                                             symbols
      appear.\n\n-   All symbols will lock in place and pay during each spin in which
      they appear.\n\n-   Each player starts with a                     Coin symbol
      in the center position.\n\n-   Coin values are equal to the player's Party
      Points when entering the Bonus.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS_1_1
    value: <style=coinColor><size=30><b>100 X Party Points</size></style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS_1_2
    value: <style=coinColor><size=30><b>50 X Party Points</size></style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS_1_3
    value: <style=coinColor><size=30><b>20 X Party Points</size></style></b>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS_1_4
    value: <style=coinColor><size=30><b>10 X Party Points</size></style></b>
